 * {{Symbol|Attack Modifier}}
** Glaives of Wisdom is an active attack modifier, and has the following properties:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Cast Range|CastRange]] {{=}} Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]]}}
*** Specifically affected by {{M|attack range}} sources of the same range-type as the caster.
** Both {{M|Autocast}} and an active cast uses Silencer's current {{M|attack range}}.
*** Has Autocast off by default.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*** This ability component can't be applied by other [[instant attack]] sources.
** All ability components do not apply to the following units:
*** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Couriers}}
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

* The ability has two main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|21px|1]]
*** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|silencer_glaives_of_wisdom_buff}} and {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|silencer_glaives_of_wisdom_debuff}}
**** Both the enemy base {{M|intelligence}} reduction and self-gain component stacks and functions independently of each other.
**** Both modifiers consider {{M|clones}} and the {{H|Spirit Bear}} as heroes; {{M|illusions}} and other {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
*** The ability effects are applied as follows per successful attack:
***# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|silencer_glaives_of_wisdom_debuff_counter}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
***#* Reduces the attacked enemy unit's base {{M|intelligence}}.
***#* Cannot reduce the base intelligence below 0.
***#* {{Symbol|Death}} {{to}} {{Symbol|bonus int}}
***#** Restores the enemy's [[attributes]] back to the original values upon its death.
***#** Does not affect Silencer's buff.
***# {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|silencer_glaives_of_wisdom_buff_counter}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
***#* Grants bonus {{M|intelligence}}.
***#* {{Symbol|Death}} {{to}} {{Symbol|bonus int}}
***#** The base intelligence gain duration is dispelled upon Silencer's death.
***#** Does not affect the debuff applied on the affected enemy unit.
***# Checks Silencer's {{M|intelligence}} upon a successful attack, then applies the {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} value.
***# Silencer's attack instance.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|21px|2]]
*** {{cf|shdnotes}} Adds a passive component to Glaives of Wisdom.
**** {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-to}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
***** [[File:Dota2 Silencer Glaives of Wisdom Bounce icon-1.png|84px|Glaives of Wisdom Bounce Visualized]][[File:Dota2 Silencer Glaives of Wisdom Bounce icon-2.png|84px|Glaives of Wisdom Bounce Visualized]]
****** The successful attack now bounce toward a random enemy unit within [[Wikipedia:Circle|circle]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-b.png|B|21px]] , centered around the the primary attacked enemy unit [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] , without priorities.
****** When no other targets are available, nothing happens.
****** Can affect other enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus atk}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{Show|H|Silencer|atkrange}}+{{#var:Glaives of Wisdom type1 value1 shd}}}}|shd}}-distance away with the [[attack range]] and the secondary target search radius.
*** The ability effects are applied as follows on the bounced attack:
***# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|silencer_glaives_of_wisdom_debuff_counter}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
***#* Reduces the affected enemy unit's base {{M|intelligence}}.
***#* Cannot reduce the base intelligence below 0.
***# {{Symbol|Damage|Physical}} {{Symbol|Spell Damage}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
***#* The bounce projectile applies [[physical]] [[spell damage]], and is defined as:
***#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Spell Damage|SpellDmg]] {{=}} ( ( (Min[[Base Attack Damage|Base]]Atk + Max[[Base Attack Damage|Base]]Atk) / 2 + Σ[[Intelligence|Int]]) × [[Critical Strike|Crit]]Factor)}}
***#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Flag}}
***#** The spell damage applied has the following damage flags:
***#*** {{M|No-spell-lifesteal}}
***#*** {{M|No-spell-amplification}}
***#* Does not interact with the following sources:
***#** After reductions-type damage manipulation sources.
***#* Interacts with the following sources:
***#** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
***#*** Bonus {{M|conditional attack damage}} sources that are explicitly considered by {{M|critical strike}} sources.
***#** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
***#*** Before reductions-type [[damage manipulation]] sources.
***#*** {{M|Damage block}} sources.
***#*** {{M|Instant kills}} the {{U|Undying Zombie}}.
***#*** Specifically {{A|Mars|Bulwark}}, but not the {{A|Void Spirit|Resonant Pulse}} {{M|damage barrier|t=phy|text=physical damage barrier}} component.
***# {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|silencer_glaives_of_wisdom_buff_counter}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
***#* Grants bonus {{M|intelligence}}.
***# Checks Silencer's {{M|intelligence}}, then applies the {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} value.
<hr>
* {{cf|shdnotes}}
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-to}}
*** The attack does not bounce back to the same units per cast.
*** Bounce to the following units:
**** {{M|Buildings}}
**** {{M|Ethereal}} units, but does not apply a damage instance in the {{M|combat log}}.
**** {{M|Outposts}}
**** {{M|Untargetable}} units.
*** Does not bounce to the following units:
**** {{M|Couriers}}
**** {{M|Fogged units}}.
**** {{M|Invisible}} units.
**** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-off}}
*** Bounces off upon attacking the following units:
**** {{M|Couriers|x}}
**** {{M|Ward-type units|x}}.

