 * The ability has two main components, utilizing the same {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|silencer_curse_of_the_silent}} applied.
** Both ability components do not proc on sources that do not proc {{M|on-cast effects}}.
** Reapplying the debuff applies another independent instance.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}}
*** The debuff duration is extended in the following conditions:
**** Applies the penalty duration and increases the first debuff duration whenever the debuff-affected enemy unit casts an ability.
**** {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Silence}}
***** Checks if the debuff-affected enemy is affected by [[silence]] sources in {{#var:Arcane Curse basic1}} second intervals, and applies the following bonus ability effects:
****** Increases the debuff duration by {{#var:Arcane Curse basic1}} second continuously.
******* {{cf|expr}} {{Code|RemainingDebuffDuration + 1}}
****** The {{M|movement speed}} slow factor.
****** The spell damage per second bonus factor.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Move Speed}} {{Symbol|a|Down}}
*** Applies the [[movement speed]] slow.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Damage|Magical}} {{Symbol|Spell Damage}}
*** {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} ...  {{Symbol|DoT|Off}}
**** Applies the first damage upon cast.
*** {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} ...  {{Symbol|DoT|Off}}
**** Deals [[magical]] [[spell damage]] in 1-second intervals, 1 second after debuff application.
**** {{Symbol|fx|s}}
***** The ability sound effect per damage instance applied on the affected enemy unit is only audible to the debuff-affected enemy.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Arcane Curse icon0}}
| desc = Curses the target area, dealing damage and causing enemies to take damage over time and slowing their movement speed.<br><br>Anytime affected enemies cast a spell, the duration is increased. The duration is paused as long as the target is silenced.
}}

